**Problem:** A generic set of stories �?otold in one town�?? does not establish that they come from the learners�?T own community. Nor does one visitor�?Ts story necessarily supply the two stories the comparison requires. The local progression and [official standard, PDF page 10](https://www.nationalartsstandards.org/sites/default/files/2021-11/Theatre%20at%20a%20Glance%20-%20new%20copyright%20info.pdf#page=10) retain that community connection.

