Each check day: set-up 3, warm-up 3, the groups plan the fresh task from a new card (8), six groups of five perform
it for about 3 minutes each (18) while the audience writes, close 4; the teacher marks one group at a time and hears
no talk that day. Every student's evidence is collected once in a window; no artifact is scored twice. Days above are
band course days (year 7 starts on day 65, year 8 on day 129).

