| Playing together | th-k-show (unit 1, days 1 to 18) | th-g1-show (unit 5): group decisions and a changed plot | th-g2-show (unit 9) retrieves th-g1-show (unit 5, days 65 to 80): lines changed and a scene shared with the class | Join and add, then decide and change, then work up and share a scene |
